     "text": "",
     "listitems": [
      {
       "uid": "82",
       "title": "Alpine Hide",
       "text": "<ul><li>1,800 square metres of luxury space for a maximum of 22 - 24 guests.</li><li>9 suites from 49 to 163 square metres with private terrace or loggia with direct access to the alpine meadows and views of Zugspitze</li><li>Rooftop suite with 2 loggias and private sauna</li><li>High-quality suite amenities such as Dyson hairdryer, record player, jukebox, curated book selection</li><li>Guests under the age of 16 are also welcome when booking the entire space</li></ul>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "83",
       "title": "Services Included",
       "text": "<ul><li>All-in food &amp; drinks with individual culinary wishes</li><li>Personalised service from the hosts</li><li>Experience guide for private outdoor experiences</li><li>Cultural and creative experiences in the house's own studio</li><li>Wellness coach for personalised treatments</li><li>Use of the SPA <i>roa </i>with saunas, new alpine meadow infinity pool, various other water pools and relaxation room with infrared and sound loungers</li><li>Shuttle / cable car and personal pick-up service</li><li>Covered car park at the Ehrwalder Alm cable car</li><li>Cable car ticket in summer / ski pass in winter</li><li>Premium mountain bikes</li><li>Organisation of rental equipment for outdoor activities&nbsp;</li></ul>"
      }
     ]
    }
   },
